the LWC question everyone gets wrong:

@wire = fetch data from Salesforce
@api = expose a prop to the parent component
@track = make an object or array reactive

sounds simple. but the exam gives you a scenario and asks which decorator 'best fits.'

the trick is knowing WHEN each one applies, not just what each one is.
